              "summary": "{\n  \"name\": \"results_df\",\n  \"rows\": 5,\n  \"fields\": [\n    {\n      \"column\": \"Model\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"string\",\n        \"num_unique_values\": 5,\n        \"samples\": [\n          \"Lasso\",\n          \"Random Forest\",\n          \"Ridge\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"R2\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0.0019944197403393336,\n        \"min\": 0.9938855300068556,\n        \"max\": 0.9984263636823413,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 5,\n        \"samples\": [\n          0.9984263363831538,\n          0.9938855300068556,\n          0.9984101333060926\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"MAE\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 3558.150436485567,\n        \"min\": 8174.583600006616,\n        \"max\": 16114.289643937647,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 5,\n        \"samples\": [\n          8174.748373814552,\n          16114.289643937647,\n          8241.586910533184\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"MSE\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 128558017.01245672,\n        \"min\": 101434798.50563587,\n        \"max\": 394131747.44603425,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 5,\n        \"samples\": [\n          101436558.18006425,\n          394131747.44603425,\n          102480990.00870743\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 19
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "results = []\n",
        "predictions = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "for name, model in models.items():\n",
        "    model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "    y_pred = model.predict(X_test)\n",
        "    predictions[name] = y_pred\n",
        "    results.append({\n",
        "        \"Model\": name,\n",
        "        \"R2\": r2_score(y_test, y_pred),\n",
        "        \"MAE\": mean_absolute_error(y_test, y_pred),\n",
        "        \"MSE\": mean_squared_error(y_test, y_pred),\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "results_df = pd.DataFrame(results).set_index(\"Model\").sort_values(\"R2\", ascending=False)\n",
        "results_df\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "2e31d3eb",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2e31d3eb"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Завдання 16. Графічне порівняння прогнозів\n",
        "Для кожної моделі побудуйте графік **фактичні значення vs прогнозовані значення**. Додайте лінію ідеального прогнозу."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 20,
      "id": "c9dae2a7",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "c9dae2a7",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 639
        },
        "outputId": "272dd737-ec99-4fd1-eb68-399ff0a87084"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 1600x900 with 6 Axes>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(16, 9))\n",
        "axes = axes.ravel()\n",
        "lims = [min(y_test.min(), min(p.min() for p in predictions.values())),\n",
        "        max(y_test.max(), max(p.max() for p in predictions.values()))]\n",
        "\n",
        "for ax, (name, y_pred) in zip(axes, predictions.items()):\n",
        "    ax.scatter(y_test, y_pred, alpha=0.5, s=18)\n",
        "    ax.plot(lims, lims, \"r--\", label=\"Ідеальний прогноз\")\n",
        "    ax.set_title(f\"{name} (R² = {r2_score(y_test, y_pred):.3f})\")\n",
        "    ax.set_xlabel(\"Фактична ціна\")\n",
        "    ax.set_ylabel(\"Прогнозована ціна\")\n",
        "    ax.legend()\n",
        "\n",
        "for ax in axes[len(predictions):]:\n",
        "    ax.axis(\"off\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "de7c766d",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "de7c766d"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 8. Підбір гіперпараметрів Random Forest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "29d482cb",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "29d482cb"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Завдання 17. GridSearchCV\n",
        "Виконайте підбір оптимальних параметрів для `RandomForestRegressor` за допомогою `GridSearchCV`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Дослідіть щонайменше такі параметри:\n",
        "- `n_estimators`;\n",
        "- `max_features`;\n",
        "- `max_depth`;\n",
        "- `min_samples_split`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Використайте крос-валідацію та метрику `R²`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 21,
      "id": "40cb926c",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "40cb926c",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "437e338b-6f89-4557-96ad-975d9d1cc79c"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Fitting 5 folds for each of 108 candidates, totalling 540 fits\n",
            "Найкращі параметри: {'max_depth': None, 'max_features': 1.0, 'min_samples_split': 2, 'n_estimators': 300}\n",
            "Найкращий CV R²: 0.9920\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "param_grid = {\n",
        "    \"n_estimators\": [100, 200, 300],\n",
        "    \"max_features\": [\"sqrt\", \"log2\", 1.0],\n",
        "    \"max_depth\": [None, 5, 10, 20],\n",
        "    \"min_samples_split\": [2, 5, 10],\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "grid = GridSearchCV(\n",
        "    estimator=RandomForestRegressor(random_state=42),\n",
        "    param_grid=param_grid,\n",
        "    scoring=\"r2\",\n",
        "    cv=5,\n",
        "    n_jobs=-1,\n",
        "    verbose=1,\n",
        ")\n",
        "grid.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Найкращі параметри:\", grid.best_params_)\n",
        "print(f\"Найкращий CV R²: {grid.best_score_:.4f}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "21c4207b",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "21c4207b"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Завдання 18. Оптимізована модель Random Forest\n",
        "Створіть нову модель з найкращими параметрами, навчіть її та обчисліть `R²`, `MAE`, `MSE` на тестовій вибірці."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 22,
      "id": "3aad9489",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3aad9489",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "99e09e8f-0ec1-4132-85f3-4fca3cb43ccd"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "{'R2': 0.9940298846807288, 'MAE': 15930.637875446102, 'MSE': 384826810.1531117}"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 22
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "best_rf = RandomForestRegressor(**grid.best_params_, random_state=42)\n",
        "best_rf.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
        "y_pred_best = best_rf.predict(X_test)\n",
        "\n",
        "rf_tuned = {\n",
        "    \"R2\": r2_score(y_test, y_pred_best),\n",
        "    \"MAE\": mean_absolute_error(y_test, y_pred_best),\n",
        "    \"MSE\": mean_squared_error(y_test, y_pred_best),\n",
        "}\n",
        "rf_tuned\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "7a84b966",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7a84b966"
      },
      "source": [
